Regression test: a Draw or Impress selection change requested from another thread runs on the main thread.

A remote UNO client (bridge thread) deselecting a shape rebuilds the view shell stack and sidebar
panels. On Windows that deadlocks against the main thread (SolarMutex released for cross-thread
window creation while the ViewShellManager mutex is held). The test deselects from a worker thread
while the main thread handles events and checks that the selection change notification arrives on
the main thread. DrawController serves Draw and Impress; both are tested.

License: the new test file is HST-owned (LicenseRef-HST-Proprietary); the makefile keeps MPL-2.0.
Test: CppunitTest_sd_a11y.
